# Telegram Bot Demo: Personalized Game Prototype

This is a simplified and anonymized demo of a Telegram bot developed as an interactive game with branching choices, originally designed for a private scenario.

## ✨ Features

- Uses `python-telegram-bot` for interaction
- Implements a quiz-style dialogue with personalized responses
- Demonstrates conditional logic and inline keyboard navigation


## 📝 Note

All personal content has been removed or replaced with neutral examples. This demo is intended to show the logic and structure of a personalized Telegram interaction.
